earchButton, RecentSearches\n347-- **Initial state**: Valid search parameters filled in, no recent searches\n348-- **Action**: User clicks Search, then navigates back to the Search page\n349-- **Expected**: The search appears in the recent searches section showing origin → destination, dates, and passenger count.\n350-\n--\n366:- **Components**: RecentSearches, AirportAutocomplete, DatePicker, PassengerCountSelector, TripTypeSelector, CabinClassSelector\n367-- **Initial state**: A recent search exists (LAX → JFK, Mar 25 – Apr 1, 2 adults, Business class, Round trip)\n368-- **Action**: User clicks on the recent search entry\n369-- **Expected**: The search form is populated with the recent search parameters: origin = LAX, destination = JFK, departure = Mar 25, return = Apr 1, passengers = 2 adults, cabin class = Business, trip type = Round trip. The search is executed and the app navigates to the results page.\n370-\n371-#### Test: RecentSearches displays multiple recent searches in order\n372-- **Components**: RecentSearches\n373-- **Initial state**: User has performed 3 searches in order: (1) LAX→JFK, (2) SFO→ORD, (3) LAX→LHR\n374-- **Action**: User navigates back to the search page\n375-- **Expected**: All three recent searches are displayed with the most recent (LAX→LHR) shown first.\n376-\n--\n463:- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar, CabinClassSelector\n464-- **Initial state**: Results page showing Economy search\n465-- **Action**: User clicks the cabin class parameter in the summary bar\n466-- **Expected**: A dropdown opens showing Economy, Premium Economy, Business, First. User selects \"Business\". The search re-executes with Business class and results update with new pricing.\n467-\n468-#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline editor closes without changes on outside click\n469-- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar\n470-- **Initial state**: User has clicked the origin parameter and the inline editor is open\n471-- **Action**: User clicks outside the inline editor\n472-- **Expected**: The inline editor closes. The original search parameters are unchanged. No re-search occurs.\n473-","numLines":182}}
